== D4. univalence superselection from the silent-seam principle ==
  cross-sector superposition: interference record before = [1. 0.]
  after GLOBAL 2pi rotation (a closed, evidence-free motion): [0. 1.]
  record change = 1.000000 under an identity motion
  -> an evidence-free closed motion altering a sealed record is a SILENT
     SEAM: excluded.  Within a sector the same motion changes nothing
     (max change 4.4e-16).  Hence coherent boson/fermion superpositions
     are excluded: univalence superselection is DERIVED, not postulated.

